      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514651::chunk::000::abstract::ae847ae7a5"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Hf and Mo additions will form coherent nanoprecipitates.",
