      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective oxide layers may include Al2O3, Cr2O3, or SiO2.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hf- and Mo-induced precipitates will provide precipitation strengthening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5627260::chunk::001::introduction::40d6c7eeec",
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stable oxide layers will improve oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will improve high-temperature tensile strength.",
